 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's a lot of people to organize. Have you talked to them about what kind event they'd like, and when they' available? Nice. That gives you some flexibility. A Saturday evening might work well, so people don't miss work. If you want to try, go for it. A shared meal is one of the things people most look forward to in these trips. Great. Set a time limit for each person to speak, and encourage everyone to contribute. People usually stay in same room together, and bring blankets if anyone gets cold. A big living room is ideal.",
